   "title": "Premium Old Skool 36 Pearlized Mens Lifestyle Shoes (Pearlized Marshmallow White)",
   "handle": "vans-zb8cda-premium-old-skool-36-pearlized-mens-lifestyle-shoes-pearlized-marshmallow-white",
   "body_html": "<b>Vans</b> <br>\r\nA polished take on an icon, the Old Skool 36 Pearlized brings subtle shine to a timeless silhouette. Premium suede and canvas uppers pair with pearlized detailing, while a Sola Foam ADC insole delivers all-day comfort. Finished with a glossy sidewall, leather Sidestripe™ and signature waffle outsole, it's rooted in the design that’s defined the Old Skool since 1977. <br><br>\r\n<b> Specs </b> <br>\r\nSkate-inspired, low-top shoe<br>\r\nCanvas and suede upper layers two textures<br>\r\nLace-up closure for an adjustable fit",
