   "title": "Premium Old Skool 36 Flame Mens Lifestyle Shoes (Black/Red)",
   "handle": "vans-d9rcjk-premium-old-skool-36-flame-mens-lifestyle-shoes-black-red",
   "body_html": "<b> Vans</b> <br>\r\nThe Premium Old Skool 36 stays true to the original Style 36 with sharper edges and a shorter toe cap, then levels it up with modern comfort upgrades. Heritage proportions meet elevated materials and embellishments for a premium take on a Vans original that’s built to stand out and keep you comfortable all day. <br><br>\r\n<b> Specs </b> <br>\r\nSkate-inspired, low-top shoe<br>\r\nLace-up closure for an adjustable fit<br>\r\nSoft padded collar for enhanced comfort<br>\r\nHigher sidewall with gloss finish",
